#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:4
msgid "結合次数"
msgstr "Bond Order"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:6
msgid ""
"**結合次数** は、原子間の化学結合の程度を表す指標である。化学結合の基本的な "
"分類では、単結合、二重結合、三重結合にそれぞれ1、2、3を対応させる。電子状態 "
"計算から評価した結合次数は整数とは限らず、その定義も複数ある。本稿では、 分子軌道の電子数による定義から出発し、密度行列の非対角要素による定義 "
"（Coulson結合次数）とそのエネルギー上の意味、Wiberg・Mayerの結合指数との関係を 式で追う。"
msgstr ""
"**Bond order** measures the degree of chemical bonding between atoms. In "
"the basic classification of chemical bonds, single, double, and triple "
"bonds correspond to 1, 2, and 3, respectively. Bond orders obtained from "
"electronic structure calculations need not be integers, and there are "
"several ways to define them. This article starts with the definition "
"based on molecular orbital populations. It then uses equations to derive "
"the definition based on off-diagonal density matrix elements (the Coulson"
" bond order), explain its relation to energy, and connect it to the "
"Wiberg bond index and the Mayer bond index."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:13
msgid ""
"**前提知識**: :ref:`タイト・バインディング近似<tightbinding>`、:ref:`開放端の鎖の固有状態<fc-"
"standing-waves>`、 :ref:`Löwdin解析<lowdin>` の密度行列。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisites**: the :ref:`tight-binding approximation <tightbinding>`,"
" :ref:`eigenstates of an open-ended chain <fc-standing-waves>`, and the "
"density matrix from :ref:`Löwdin analysis <lowdin>`."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:16
msgid "**学習目標**:"
msgstr "**Learning objectives**:"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:18
msgid "結合性・反結合性軌道の電子数から結合次数を求める。"
msgstr ""
"Calculate bond order from the electron populations of bonding and "
"antibonding orbitals."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:19
msgid "密度行列の非対角要素が結合次数になることを、二原子分子で確かめる。"
msgstr ""
"Verify for a diatomic molecule that an off-diagonal density matrix "
"element gives the bond order."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:20
msgid "結合次数がホッピングに対するエネルギーの微分であることを導く。"
msgstr ""
"Derive the bond order from the derivative of the energy with respect to "
"hopping."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:21
msgid "一様な半充填鎖の結合次数 :math:`2/\\pi` と、有限鎖の端による交替を導く。"
msgstr ""
"Derive the bond order :math:`2/\\pi` of a uniform chain at half filling "
"and the bond alternation caused by the ends of a finite chain."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:22
msgid "Wiberg・Mayer結合指数との関係と、指標の限界を説明する。"
msgstr ""
"Explain the relation to the Wiberg bond index and the Mayer bond index "
"and the limitations of these measures."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:25
msgid "分子軌道の電子数による定義"
msgstr "Definition in Terms of Molecular Orbital Populations"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:27
msgid ""
"二原子分子では、2つの原子軌道から結合性軌道と反結合性軌道ができる。それぞれに 入る電子数を "
":math:`N_{\\mathrm{bonding}}`、:math:`N_{\\mathrm{antibonding}}` とすると、"
msgstr ""
"In a diatomic molecule, two atomic orbitals form a bonding and an "
"antibonding orbital. Let their electron populations be "
":math:`N_{\\mathrm{bonding}}` and :math:`N_{\\mathrm{antibonding}}`, "
"respectively. The bond order is defined as"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:30
msgid "b=\\frac{N_{\\mathrm{bonding}}-N_{\\mathrm{antibonding}}}{2}"
msgstr "b=\\frac{N_{\\mathrm{bonding}}-N_{\\mathrm{antibonding}}}{2}"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:35
msgid ""
"を結合次数とする。電子対1組が1本の結合に対応するように2で割っている。例えば "
"水素分子の基底状態では、結合性軌道に電子が2個入り、反結合性軌道は空なので :math:`b=1` である。He\\ :sub:`2`\\ "
"では両方に2個ずつ入るので :math:`b=0` となり、 安定な結合をつくらないことと対応する。"
msgstr ""
"The factor of 2 in the denominator makes one electron pair correspond to "
"one bond. For example, in the ground state of the hydrogen molecule, the "
"bonding orbital contains two electrons and the antibonding orbital is "
"empty, giving a bond order of :math:`b=1`. In He\\ :sub:`2`\\ , both "
"orbitals contain two electrons, giving :math:`b=0`, consistent with the "
"absence of a stable bond."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:40
msgid "この定義は、軌道を結合性・反結合性に分類できる簡単な分子でしか使えない。 多原子系に一般化するには、軌道の分類ではなく、原子間の密度行列要素を使う。"
msgstr ""
"This definition applies only to simple molecules whose orbitals can be "
"classified as bonding or antibonding. To generalize it to polyatomic "
"systems, use density matrix elements between atoms instead of classifying"
" orbitals."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:44
msgid "密度行列による定義（Coulson結合次数）"
msgstr "Definition from the Density Matrix (Coulson Bond Order)"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:46
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"各原子に1つずつ直交した軌道 :math:`|r\\rangle` を置き、分子軌道を :math:`\\psi_i=\\sum_r "
"c_{ri}|r\\rangle`\\ （係数は実数）と展開する。Coulsonは π電子系に対して、原子 :math:`r` と "
":math:`s` の間の結合次数を"
msgstr ""
"Place one orbital :math:`|r\\rangle` on each atom, with the orbitals "
"forming an orthonormal basis. Expand each molecular orbital as "
":math:`\\psi_i=\\sum_r c_{ri}|r\\rangle`\\ (with real coefficients). For "
"a π-electron system, Coulson defined the bond order between atoms "
":math:`r` and :math:`s` as"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:50
#, python-brace-format
msgid "p_{rs}=\\sum_i n_i\\,c_{ri}\\,c_{si}"
msgstr "p_{rs}=\\sum_i n_i\\,c_{ri}\\,c_{si}"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:55
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"と定義した [Coulson1939]_。ここで :math:`n_i` は軌道 :math:`i` の占有数である。 "
"これは直交基底での密度行列の非対角要素 :math:`P_{rs}` そのものである。"
msgstr ""
"[Coulson1939]_. Here :math:`n_i` is the occupation number of orbital "
":math:`i`. The bond order is exactly the off-diagonal density matrix "
"element :math:`P_{rs}` in the orthogonal basis."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:58
msgid ""
"二原子分子でこの定義が :eq:`bo-mo` と一致することを確かめる。結合性軌道と 反結合性軌道の係数は "
":math:`(1,1)/\\sqrt2` と :math:`(1,-1)/\\sqrt2` なので、"
msgstr ""
"For a diatomic molecule, this definition agrees with Equation :eq:`bo-"
"mo`. The coefficients of the bonding and antibonding orbitals are "
":math:`(1,1)/\\sqrt2` and :math:`(1,-1)/\\sqrt2`, respectively, giving"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:61
msgid ""
"p_{12}=N_{\\mathrm{bonding}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}"
"\n"
"+N_{\\mathrm{antibonding}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\right)"
"\n"
"=\\frac{N_{\\mathrm{bonding}}-N_{\\mathrm{antibonding}}}{2}"
msgstr ""
"p_{12}=N_{\\mathrm{bonding}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}"
"\n"
"+N_{\\mathrm{antibonding}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\right)"
"\n"
"=\\frac{N_{\\mathrm{bonding}}-N_{\\mathrm{antibonding}}}{2}"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:67
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"となる。結合性軌道の電子は :math:`p_{rs}` を増やし、反結合性軌道の電子は減らす。 :eq:`bo-coulson` "
"は、この寄与をすべての占有軌道について足し合わせたものである。"
msgstr ""
"Electrons in bonding orbitals increase :math:`p_{rs}`, whereas electrons "
"in antibonding orbitals decrease it. Equation :eq:`bo-coulson` sums these"
" contributions over all occupied orbitals."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:70
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"基底関数が直交していない第一原理計算では、:ref:`Löwdin直交化<lowdin>` した 密度行列 :math:`P^{\\mathrm "
"L}=S^{1/2}DS^{1/2}` の非対角要素を使うのが一つの方法である。 1原子1基底関数の場合、隣接原子 "
":math:`i`、:math:`i+1` の間の量"
msgstr ""
"In first-principles calculations with nonorthogonal basis functions, one "
"option is to apply :ref:`Löwdin orthogonalization <lowdin>` and use off-"
"diagonal elements of the resulting density matrix :math:`P^{\\mathrm "
"L}=S^{1/2}DS^{1/2}`. With one basis function per atom, the quantity for "
"neighboring atoms :math:`i` and :math:`i+1`,"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:74
#, python-brace-format
msgid "B_i=P^{\\mathrm L}_{i,i+1}"
msgstr "B_i=P^{\\mathrm L}_{i,i+1}"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:79
msgid ""
"はCoulson結合次数を非直交基底に拡張したものと見なせる。:math:`B_i` の符号は "
"基底関数の位相の取り方に依存するので、比較するときは位相を揃えておく。"
msgstr ""
"can be viewed as an extension of the Coulson bond order to a "
"nonorthogonal basis. The sign of :math:`B_i` depends on the choice of "
"phase for the basis functions, so use consistent phases when comparing "
"values."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:83
msgid "エネルギーとの関係"
msgstr "Relation to Energy"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:85
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Coulson結合次数には、エネルギー上の明確な意味がある。電子間相互作用を含まない タイト・バインディング模型で、ハミルトニアンの行列要素を "
":math:`h_{rs}` とすると、 全エネルギーは"
msgstr ""
"The Coulson bond order has a direct connection to energy. In a tight-"
"binding model without electron–electron interactions, let the Hamiltonian"
" matrix elements be :math:`h_{rs}`. The total energy is"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:89
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"E=\\sum_i n_i\\langle\\psi_i|\\hat H|\\psi_i\\rangle\n"
"=\\sum_i n_i\\sum_{rs}c_{ri}h_{rs}c_{si}\n"
"=\\sum_{rs}h_{rs}P_{rs}"
msgstr ""
"E=\\sum_i n_i\\langle\\psi_i|\\hat H|\\psi_i\\rangle\n"
"=\\sum_i n_i\\sum_{rs}c_{ri}h_{rs}c_{si}\n"
"=\\sum_{rs}h_{rs}P_{rs}"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:95
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"と密度行列で書ける。1次元鎖でオンサイトエネルギーを :math:`\\varepsilon_0`、 :math:`i` 番目の結合のホッピングを"
" :math:`h_{i,i+1}=-t_i` とすると、 :math:`P_{rs}=P_{sr}` より"
msgstr ""
"This expresses the energy in terms of the density matrix. For a one-"
"dimensional chain, let :math:`\\varepsilon_0` be the on-site energy and "
"let the hopping matrix element for bond :math:`i` be "
":math:`h_{i,i+1}=-t_i`. Since :math:`P_{rs}=P_{sr}`, the energy becomes"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:99
#, python-brace-format
msgid "E=\\varepsilon_0\\sum_rP_{rr}-2\\sum_it_i\\,B_i"
msgstr "E=\\varepsilon_0\\sum_rP_{rr}-2\\sum_it_i\\,B_i"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:104
msgid ""
"となる。占有数を固定してホッピング :math:`t_i` を少し変えるとき、 "
"Hellmann–Feynmanの定理により固有ベクトルの変化はエネルギーの1次の変化に寄与しない。 したがって"
msgstr ""
"When the hopping :math:`t_i` changes slightly at fixed occupation "
"numbers, the Hellmann–Feynman theorem says that changes in the "
"eigenvectors do not contribute to the first-order change in energy. "
"Therefore,"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:108
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\frac{\\partial E}{\\partial t_i}=-2B_i"
msgstr "\\frac{\\partial E}{\\partial t_i}=-2B_i"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:112
msgid ""
"である。結合次数が大きい結合ほど、ホッピングを強めたときにエネルギーが大きく下がる。 この意味で、:math:`B_i` "
"は各結合が全エネルギーに寄与する重みを表す。"
msgstr ""
"The larger the bond order, the more the energy decreases when hopping is "
"strengthened. In this sense, :math:`B_i` weights each bond's contribution"
" to the total energy."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:116
msgid "一様な鎖の結合次数"
msgstr "Bond Orders in a Uniform Chain"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:118
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"すべてのホッピングが等しい最近接タイト・バインディング鎖を半充填にした場合の 結合次数を求める。周期鎖の固有状態は "
":math:`c_n(k)=e^{ikna}/\\sqrt N` であり、 占有されるのは :math:`|k|<\\pi/(2a)` "
"の状態である。係数が複素数なので、:eq:`bo-coulson` の積の 片方に複素共役を取って "
":math:`P_{rs}=\\sum_in_i\\,c_{ri}\\,c_{si}^*` とする（実係数なら :eq:`bo-coulson` "
"に戻る）。 :eq:`bo-coulson` の和を積分に 置き換え、:math:`\\theta=ka` とおくと、"
msgstr ""
"Consider the bond order in a half-filled nearest-neighbor tight-binding "
"chain with uniform hopping. The eigenstates of the periodic chain are "
":math:`c_n(k)=e^{ikna}/\\sqrt N`, and the states with "
":math:`|k|<\\pi/(2a)` are occupied. Because the coefficients are complex,"
" take the complex conjugate of one factor in the product in Equation :eq"
":`bo-coulson`, giving :math:`P_{rs}=\\sum_in_i\\,c_{ri}\\,c_{si}^*` "
"(which reduces to Equation :eq:`bo-coulson` for real coefficients). "
"Replacing the sum in Equation :eq:`bo-coulson` with an integral and "
"setting :math:`\\theta=ka` gives"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:125
msgid ""
"P_{n,n+m}=2\\sum_{|k|<\\pi/2a}\\frac{e^{-ikma}}{N}\n"
"=\\frac{2}{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}e^{-im\\theta}\\,d\\theta\n"
"=\\frac{2\\sin(m\\pi/2)}{m\\pi}"
msgstr ""
"P_{n,n+m}=2\\sum_{|k|<\\pi/2a}\\frac{e^{-ikma}}{N}\n"
"=\\frac{2}{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}e^{-im\\theta}\\,d\\theta\n"
"=\\frac{2\\sin(m\\pi/2)}{m\\pi}"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:131
msgid "となる。先頭の2はスピンの縮重度である。隣接原子間（:math:`m=1`）では"
msgstr ""
"The leading factor of 2 is the spin degeneracy. For neighboring atoms "
"(:math:`m=1`), this yields"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:133
#, python-brace-format
msgid "B=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\approx0.637"
msgstr "B=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\approx0.637"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:138
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"を得る。:math:`B` は1より小さい。1原子1電子の鎖では、各原子の電子が左右の "
"両隣と結合を分け合い、さらに遠い原子との相関（:math:`m=3,5,\\ldots`）にも分配される ためである。偶数の "
":math:`m\\ne0` では :math:`P_{n,n+m}=0` となる。 この値は :math:`t` "
"によらない。一様な鎖の固有ベクトルは :math:`t` の大きさに 依存しないからである。"
msgstr ""
"The bond order :math:`B` is less than 1 because, in a chain with one "
"electron per atom, each atom's electron contributes to bonds with both "
"neighbors and also to correlations with more distant atoms "
"(:math:`m=3,5,\\ldots`). For even :math:`m\\ne0`, :math:`P_{n,n+m}=0`. "
"The bond order is independent of :math:`t` because the eigenvectors of "
"the uniform chain do not depend on the magnitude of :math:`t`."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:144
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"両端が開いた有限鎖では、:ref:`開放端の鎖<fc-standing-waves>` で求めた 固有ベクトル "
":math:`\\phi_j(i)=\\sqrt{2/(N+1)}\\sin\\bigl(ij\\pi/(N+1)\\bigr)` を使って"
msgstr ""
"For a finite open-ended chain, use the :ref:`standing-wave <fc-standing-"
"waves>` eigenvectors "
":math:`\\phi_j(i)=\\sqrt{2/(N+1)}\\sin\\bigl(ij\\pi/(N+1)\\bigr)` to "
"calculate"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:147
#, python-brace-format
msgid "B_i=2\\sum_{j=1}^{N/2}\\phi_j(i)\\,\\phi_j(i+1)"
msgstr "B_i=2\\sum_{j=1}^{N/2}\\phi_j(i)\\,\\phi_j(i+1)"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:152
msgid ""
"を計算する。ホッピングが一様でも端の影響で :math:`B_i` は1本おきに強弱を繰り返し、 "
"その振幅は鎖の中央に向かって小さくなる。鎖の中央での交替の振幅は :math:`N=16,32,64` "
"でそれぞれ約0.065、0.031、0.016であり、おおむね :math:`1/N` で 減少して、:math:`N\\to\\infty` "
"では一様な値 :eq:`bo-uniform` に近づく。"
msgstr ""
"Even with uniform hopping, the ends cause :math:`B_i` to alternate "
"between strong and weak bonds, with an amplitude that decreases toward "
"the center. At the center, the alternation amplitudes are about 0.065, "
"0.031, and 0.016 for :math:`N=16,32,64`, respectively. They decrease "
"approximately as :math:`1/N`, and as :math:`N\\to\\infty` the bond order "
"approaches the uniform value in Equation :eq:`bo-uniform`."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:158
msgid "価数の和則"
msgstr "Valence Sum Rule"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:160
msgid ""
"閉殻の単一行列式では、直交基底での密度行列が :math:`P^2=2P` を満たす （:ref:`Löwdin解析<lowdin>` "
"で見たように :math:`P/2` は射影である）。 その :math:`(r,r)` 成分を取ると"
msgstr ""
"For a closed-shell single determinant, the density matrix in an "
"orthogonal basis satisfies :math:`P^2=2P` (as shown in :ref:`Löwdin "
"analysis <lowdin>`, :math:`P/2` is a projector). Taking the :math:`(r,r)`"
" element gives"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:164
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\sum_sP_{rs}^2=2P_{rr}"
msgstr "\\sum_sP_{rs}^2=2P_{rr}"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:168
#, python-brace-format
msgid "となる。1原子1軌道で :math:`P_{rr}=1` のとき、"
msgstr "With one orbital per atom and :math:`P_{rr}=1`, this gives"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:170
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\sum_{s\\ne r}P_{rs}^2=1"
msgstr "\\sum_{s\\ne r}P_{rs}^2=1"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:175
msgid ""
"を得る。各原子が他の原子と結合に使える総量は一定であり、それが相手の原子に 分配されることを表す。水素分子では "
":math:`P_{12}^2=1` で1本の単結合になる。 一様な無限鎖では、最近接の2本で "
":math:`2(2/\\pi)^2\\approx0.81`、残りは遠い原子との :math:`m=3,5,\\ldots` "
"の項が担い、:math:`\\sum_{m\\,\\mathrm{odd}}8/(m\\pi)^2=1` で和則が 満たされる。"
msgstr ""
"This sum rule shows that each atom has a fixed total bonding capacity, "
"which is distributed among the other atoms. In the hydrogen molecule, "
":math:`P_{12}^2=1` gives one single bond. In a uniform infinite chain, "
"the two nearest-neighbor bonds contribute "
":math:`2(2/\\pi)^2\\approx0.81`, and the terms for more distant atoms "
"with :math:`m=3,5,\\ldots` supply the rest. The sum rule is satisfied "
"because :math:`\\sum_{m\\,\\mathrm{odd}}8/(m\\pi)^2=1`."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:182
msgid "Wiberg結合指数とMayer結合次数"
msgstr "Wiberg Bond Index and Mayer Bond Order"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:184
msgid "直交基底での密度行列を使い、原子 :math:`A` と :math:`B` の間の結合指数を"
msgstr ""
"In an orthogonal basis, the density matrix gives the following bond index"
" between atoms :math:`A` and :math:`B`:"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:186
#, python-brace-format
msgid "W_{AB}=\\sum_{\\mu\\in A}\\sum_{\\nu\\in B}P_{\\mu\\nu}^2"
msgstr "W_{AB}=\\sum_{\\mu\\in A}\\sum_{\\nu\\in B}P_{\\mu\\nu}^2"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:191
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"と定義したものが **Wiberg結合指数** である [Wiberg1968]_。1原子1軌道では "
":math:`W_{i,i+1}=B_i^2` となる。2乗しているので位相の取り方に依存せず、1原子に "
"複数の基底関数がある場合も原子の組ごとにまとめられる。:eq:`bo-valence` は、 "
"Wiberg指数の和が原子の価数になるという関係の特別な場合である。"
msgstr ""
"This is the **Wiberg bond index** [Wiberg1968]_. With one orbital per "
"atom, :math:`W_{i,i+1}=B_i^2`. Squaring makes the index independent of "
"the phase convention, and the sum groups contributions by atom pair even "
"when each atom has several basis functions. Equation :eq:`bo-valence` is "
"a special case of the rule that the sum of the Wiberg indices gives the "
"valence of an atom."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:196
msgid "Mayerは、非直交基底のまま使える形として、閉殻では"
msgstr ""
"Mayer proposed a form that can be used directly in a nonorthogonal basis."
" For a closed shell, it is"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:198
msgid ""
"B^{\\mathrm{Mayer}}_{AB}=\\sum_{\\mu\\in A}\\sum_{\\nu\\in "
"B}(DS)_{\\mu\\nu}(DS)_{\\nu\\mu}"
msgstr ""
"B^{\\mathrm{Mayer}}_{AB}=\\sum_{\\mu\\in A}\\sum_{\\nu\\in "
"B}(DS)_{\\mu\\nu}(DS)_{\\nu\\mu}"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:202
msgid ""
"を提案した [Mayer1983]_。直交基底（:math:`S=I`）ではWiberg指数に一致する。 "
"スピン分極した系では、スピンごとの密度行列を使った"
msgstr ""
"as proposed in [Mayer1983]_. In an orthogonal basis (:math:`S=I`), this "
"reduces to the Wiberg index. For a system with spin polarization, use the"
" density matrix for each spin to evaluate"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:205
msgid ""
"B^{\\mathrm{Mayer}}_{AB}=2\\sum_{\\mu\\in A}\\sum_{\\nu\\in B}\n"
"\\left[(D^\\alpha S)_{\\mu\\nu}(D^\\alpha S)_{\\nu\\mu}\n"
"+(D^\\beta S)_{\\mu\\nu}(D^\\beta S)_{\\nu\\mu}\\right]"
msgstr ""
"B^{\\mathrm{Mayer}}_{AB}=2\\sum_{\\mu\\in A}\\sum_{\\nu\\in B}\n"
"\\left[(D^\\alpha S)_{\\mu\\nu}(D^\\alpha S)_{\\nu\\mu}\n"
"+(D^\\beta S)_{\\mu\\nu}(D^\\beta S)_{\\nu\\mu}\\right]"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:211
msgid "が使われ、閉殻（:math:`D^\\alpha=D^\\beta=D/2`）では上の式に戻る。"
msgstr ""
"For a closed shell (:math:`D^\\alpha=D^\\beta=D/2`), this reduces to the "
"preceding expression."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:213
msgid ""
":eq:`bo-lowdin` の :math:`B_i` のような密度行列要素そのものと、それを2乗した "
"Wiberg・Mayer型の指数は、同じ結合に対しても値が異なる。どの定義を使ったかを 明記し、同じ定義・同じ計算条件の中で比較する。"
msgstr ""
"Equation :eq:`bo-lowdin` gives the density matrix element :math:`B_i` "
"itself, whereas Wiberg- and Mayer-type indices are based on squared "
"elements. The values differ even for the same bond. State which "
"definition was used and compare values obtained with the same definition "
"and calculation conditions."

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:218
msgid "説明用の事例：水素原子鎖"
msgstr "Worked Example: Hydrogen Atom Chain"

#: ../../electronic/bond_order.rst:220
msgid ""
"`水素原子を並べると電子バンドは生まれるのか <https://example.quloud-"
"platform.quemix.com/hydrogen_chain/band_formation.html>`_ では、STO-"
"3G基底（水素1原子あたり1個の基底関数）で計算した有限水素原子鎖 （原子間隔1.8 Å、Psi4 1.10）について、:eq:`bo-"
"lowdin` の :math:`B_i` を鎖に沿って 比べている。次の表は、例題の再現用データから、鎖の中央の隣り合う2本の結合の値と、 "
"中央8本の結合を1本おきの2組に分けたときの平均値の差の半分（交替振幅）を まとめたものである。比較のため、同じ定義で :eq:`bo-open-"
"chain` から求めた一様な 最近接タイト・バインディング（TB）模型の値も示す。"
msgstr ""
"The calculation example `Do Electronic Bands Form in a Hydrogen Atom "
"Chain? <https://example.quloud-"
"platform.quemix.com/hydrogen_chain/band_formation.html>`_ uses Equation "
":eq:`bo-lowdin` to compare :math:`B_i` along finite hydrogen atom chains "
"calculated with an STO-3G basis (one basis function per hydrogen atom, "
"interatomic spacing 1.8 Å, Psi4 1.10). Using the data provided to "
"reproduce the example, the table lists the values of two adjacent bonds "
"at the center of the chain and the alternation amplitude. The amplitude "
"is half the difference between the means of the two groups formed by "
"taking alternate bonds among the central eight. For comparison, the table"
" also includes the values for the uniform nearest-neighbor tight-binding "
"(TB) model from Equation :eq:`bo-open-chain` using the same definition."

